    ],
    "description": "The Gen 3's signature cooling system (dossier §2): the N493 rotary-slide thermal-management module (two coupled rotary valves, one DC motor) holds coolant anywhere between ~80–110 °C and blocks block-flow during warm-up; the mechanical pump is driven off a balance shaft, NOT the accessory belt. Front stack front→rear: condenser, radiator, intercooler, fans."
  },
