      "oemPartNumber": null,
      "description": "The Audi/Schaeffler rotary-slide valve module replacing a wax thermostat: valve 1 regulates oil-cooler/head/radiator flow (~80–110 °C, up to ~107 °C light-load for low friction), valve 2 couples the block in at ~145° of valve-1 rotation. Driven by one DC motor through a worm gear; 12 V / 1,000 Hz PWM control (dossier §2).",
